== Village Generation ==
Villages usually spawn with multiple farms and houses. The rarest buildings are weaponsmiths, butchers, temples, and libraries. Small villages may not even have one of each, but large villages can spawn with multiple of each. The "Medium House 1" is rare in post-1.14 versions, but abundant in pre-1.14.

Streets are made with [[dirt path]] and [[grass block]]s, or [[planks]] if replacing [[water]] or [[lava]]. Desert villages use [[sandstone]] instead. Streets are 3 blocks wide and lead away from the well in any of the 4 cardinal directions.  All streets are straight with intersections at right angles.  Streets don’t need to be flat across.

==== Biome Variants ====
Villages have 5 types:

* {{BiomeLink|Plains}}
* {{BiomeLink|Desert}}
* {{BiomeLink|Savanna}}
* {{BiomeLink|Taiga}}
* {{BiomeLink|Snowy Plains}}

Snowy Villages and Taiga Villages use spruce [[wood]], Savanna villages use acacia [[wood]]. There are acacia logs instead of cobblestone in savanna villages except the weaponsmith, church, and around the well. Desert villages have sandstone based variants of all the buildings substituting regular sandstone for cobblestone or wooden logs, and smooth sandstone for wooden planks. Wooden doors and fence posts are still used despite the lack of wood sources. Desert weaponsmiths still use stone slabs on the roof. Also cobblestone in the church, the weaponsmith and around the well is not replaced with sandstone.

==== Farm Crops ====
Each farm spawns as one of four types of [[crops]], chosen between [[wheat]], [[beetroot]], [[carrot]], or [[potato]]. {{IN|java}} the crops that generate on a village farm spawn as seeds, while {{in|bedrock}} they spawn as full-grown crops.

==== Abandoned Villages ====
In [[zombie village|Abandoned village]]s, [[cobweb]]s sporadically replace any block besides [[chest]]s, [[bell]]s, [[crafting table]]s, [[carpet]]s, [[water]], and [[lava]] source blocks; [[door]]s and [[torch]]es are destroyed; and all non-stained [[glass pane]]s are turned into their respective brown stained variant. All [[villager]]s that spawn in the village will instead spawn as [[zombie villager]]s. Animals and livestock spawn like normal villages. [[Cobblestone]] also has a higher chance of turning into [[mossy cobblestone]] than normal villages.

